      ],
      "text": "CodeAlta runs as a terminal workspace invoked via the `alta` command, providing a keyboard-first TUI with tabs, prompt editor, project sidebar, and command discovery."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_0eec30d1d88beb8ad7c5cc5969a19787270def7e5ad0dc07c71fbd47ec6426ec",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "interfaces",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "823f847297aafb0662ee317c3434c96a755e32fa",
          "git_sha": "0c5c5a1dbcaa0793da46684e30ae44f112e445db",
          "line_end": 55,
          "line_start": 42,
          "path": "readme.md",
          "repository": "codealta/codealta",
          "url": "https://github.com/CodeAlta/CodeAlta/blob/823f847297aafb0662ee317c3434c96a755e32fa/readme.md#L42-L55"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_09ac7e8d0f2425e41c368a3173bbaf6fe6586f15e2305762d66bb8748839b43e"
      ],
      "text": "The TUI exposes slash commands and shortcuts such as `/open` (Ctrl+O), `/prompt`, `/model_providers`, `/models`, `/logs`, and `/help`."
    },
    {
