        "slc_eac1883a3f61348868b8abf93e41bfcee9d4ce11b7d130de1accd3ef8479ff4e"
      ],
      "text": "Installation requires .NET 10 and is done via `dotnet tool install -g CodeAlta`, with updates via `dotnet tool update -g CodeAlta`."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_e3bb666a49f4d38533de7f03f341fa0088bd15e61e8ef1b96eb805698534ad2a",
