      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_5f6933bf84d4d80f681406d1e6f53997a4b69fc4e54da96285a807e6340c7fee"
      ],
      "text": "On first launch the tool creates `~/.alta/config.toml` and leaves existing config untouched on later launches; if no provider is enabled, a Model Providers dialog opens."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_62191ab58edb1d8e18a05f804eb2d7c56fd76345433ab2fc9e12d483cb5efd15",
