        "slc_5f6933bf84d4d80f681406d1e6f53997a4b69fc4e54da96285a807e6340c7fee"
      ],
      "text": "Supported model providers include Codex, Copilot, xAI Grok, OpenAI/Azure OpenAI/Alibaba APIs, Anthropic, Gemini/Vertex, and custom endpoints."
    },
